        <item>
            <title>1.0.15</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>⌘M</strong> shows or hides the Apple Music side.</li>
<li><strong>Esc</strong> closes the panel (or leaves an album page, or stops typing in search, first).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Keyboard shortcuts now work as soon as you open the app from the menu bar.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
